title: Discarding a file asks first, and Cancel leaves the file and the index untouched
folders: git-changes
expect-file: git-changes/src/steps.rs :: let two = 2;\n    two\n[\s\S]*eleven\(\)
forbid-log: script: ignoring
forbid-log: nothing offers

wait 3000
left changes
goto src/steps.rs
wait 1000
zoom 0.5
git discard src/steps.rs
wait 600
mark asked
wait 500
answer Cancel
wait 1200
mark end
wait 500
quit
